---

---

<section class="py-[clamp(80px,12vh,150px)]" id="capabilities">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="stamp text-fg-dim">GO·03</span>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow text-fg"><span class="mark bg-fg"></span>Capabilities · 01—06</p>
          <h2 class="sec-title mt-4 max-w-[20ch]">Six Disciplines, One Lab</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-[clamp(18px,2vw,28px)] max-[1020px]:grid-cols-2 max-[680px]:grid-cols-1">
        <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-5 border border-line bg-blue-deep p-[clamp(26px,3vw,40px)] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-control ease-brand hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0">
          <div class="font-display text-[34px] tracking-[0.02em] text-fg">01</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2vw,28px)] uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.02em]">Robust Builds</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-[1.6] text-fg-dim">Scalable backends and APIs that hold up in production — no surprises, no shortcuts.</p>
          <div class="mt-1 flex min-h-[96px] flex-col justify-end gap-[14px] border-t border-line pt-[18px]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-dim">The stack</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.05em] text-fg-dim">
              <span><b class="text-fg">apps/</b>&nbsp; services</span>
              <span><b class="text-fg">api/</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; contracts</span>
              <span><b class="text-fg">tests/</b>&nbsp; guardrails</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-5 border border-line bg-blue-deep p-[clamp(26px,3vw,40px)] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-control ease-brand hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0">
          <div class="font-display text-[34px] tracking-[0.02em] text-fg">02</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2vw,28px)] uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.02em]">Interfaces That Perform</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-[1.6] text-fg-dim">Fast, accessible web applications and sites — engineered around how people actually use them.</p>
          <div class="mt-1 flex min-h-[96px] flex-col justify-end gap-[14px] border-t border-line pt-[18px]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-dim">A ship-ready surface</p>
            <div class="border border-line">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line px-2.5 py-2"><i class="h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-line-strong"></i><i class="h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-line-strong"></i><i class="h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-line-strong"></i><span class="ml-1.5 flex-1 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-dim">greaterodd.com</span></div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 p-3"><i class="col-span-2 h-2.5 bg-white/30"></i><i class="h-2.5 bg-line"></i><i class="h-2.5 bg-line"></i><i class="h-2.5 bg-line"></i></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-5 border border-line bg-blue-deep p-[clamp(26px,3vw,40px)] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-control ease-brand hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0">
          <div class="font-display text-[34px] tracking-[0.02em] text-fg">03</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2vw,28px)] uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.02em]">Native &amp; Cross-Platform</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-[1.6] text-fg-dim">Mobile apps built to feel native on every device, from prototype to store-ready release.</p>
          <div class="mt-1 flex min-h-[96px] flex-col justify-end gap-[14px] border-t border-line pt-[18px]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-dim">On every pocket</p>
            <div class="flex h-[132px] w-[74px] flex-col gap-[7px] border border-line-strong px-2 py-2.5">
              <i class="h-2 w-[55%] bg-white/35"></i><i class="h-2 bg-line"></i><i class="h-2 bg-line"></i><i class="h-2 bg-line"></i><i class="h-2 bg-line"></i><i class="h-2 bg-line"></i>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-5 border border-line bg-blue-deep p-[clamp(26px,3vw,40px)] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-control ease-brand hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0">
          <div class="font-display text-[34px] tracking-[0.02em] text-fg">04</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2vw,28px)] uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.02em]">Assisted Solutions</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-[1.6] text-fg-dim">LLM-assisted features, agents, and copilots — stitched into products that already ship.</p>
          <div class="mt-1 flex min-h-[96px] flex-col justify-end gap-[14px] border-t border-line pt-[18px]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-dim">The lab thinks in prompts</p>
            <div class="font-mono text-xs leading-[1.7] tracking-[0.04em] text-fg-dim">
              <span class="p font-bold text-fg">&gt;</span> design an interface that explains itself<br/>
              <span class="p font-bold text-fg">&gt;</span> shipped, measured, iterated
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-5 border border-line bg-blue-deep p-[clamp(26px,3vw,40px)] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-control ease-brand hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0">
          <div class="font-display text-[34px] tracking-[0.02em] text-fg">05</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2vw,28px)] uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.02em]">Tooling Developers Keep</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-[1.6] text-fg-dim">Command-line tools and internal automation that make hard workflows feel like one command.</p>
          <div class="mt-1 flex min-h-[96px] flex-col justify-end gap-[14px] border-t border-line pt-[18px]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-dim">At the terminal</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-[7px] font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[0.04em] text-fg-dim">
              <span><b class="font-bold text-fg">✓</b> Automation scripts</span>
              <span><b class="font-bold text-fg">✓</b> Developer tooling</span>
              <span><b class="font-bold text-fg">✓</b> CI pipelines</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="reveal flex flex-col gap-5 border border-line bg-blue-deep p-[clamp(26px,3vw,40px)] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-control ease-brand hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-line-strong motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0">
          <div class="font-display text-[34px] tracking-[0.02em] text-fg">06</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2vw,28px)] uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.02em]">Pushing Limits</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-[1.6] text-fg-dim">Prototypes and experiments on emerging tech — where we fail fast and learn what's next.</p>
          <div class="mt-1 flex min-h-[96px] flex-col justify-end gap-[14px] border-t border-line pt-[18px]">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-dim">Always exploring</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="chip"><b class="text-ink">Prototypes</b></span>
              <span class="chip"><b class="text-ink">Emerging Tech</b></span>
              <span class="chip"><b class="text-ink">Research</b></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
